# Sandsunk Necropolis's staked store passage (CIPlay sandsunk_necropolis_spikes, 11-12 w07; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in its recipe: the passage off the hall from -40 -2 to -45.5 -10, the stakes zone snstakes at -43 -6
# (r 1.7, safe=none, pulse 2 s up / 2 s down), the lever snlever at -39.4 -3.4 in the hall, the store at -47.5 -14.5.
# Into the stakes: hurt and the message; the lever: stakes down; through to the store unhurt. Floors ~3 m.
island Sandsunk Necropolis keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
expect shown snstakes

walk -20 0 to -23 0 to -34 0 to -39 -1.5 below=8
read THE STORE OF THE EMBALMERS
at -43 -6 h=5.7
wait 5
at -39 -1.5 h=5.7
expect message thrust up out of the floor
expect hurt 4
picture sn_stakes -40.5 6.8 -2.5 -43.5 5.6 -6.5 light=20
wait 2

use snlever
wait 2
expect hidden snstakes
expect hidden snstake1
expect message stay down
wait 3
walk -39 -1.5 to -40 -2 to -43 -6 to -45.5 -10 to -47.5 -14 below=8
wait 3
expect unhurt
open Embalmers' store
expect item TradeToken 3
picture sn_store -45.5 6.8 -10 -48 5.6 -15.4 light=20
